  "{n} facturas cuadran": ["{n} factures quadren", "{n} invoices add up"],
  ": base, IVA y total coinciden, con fecha clara y sin posibles duplicados.": [": base, IVA i total coincideixen, amb data clara i sense possibles duplicats.", ": taxable base, VAT and total match, with a clear date and no possible duplicates."],
